## 📁 2. Samba Network Storage & POSIX ACLs (`smb.conf`)

* Enforce clean file masking and user group permissions to prevent `Permission Denied` errors across Windows, Mac, and Linux clients:
  ```ini
  [shared_drive]
      path = /mnt/storage/shares
      browseable = yes
      read only = no
      guest ok = no
      valid users = @nas_users
      create mask = 0664
      directory mask = 0775
      force group = nas_users
  ```
* Test Samba syntax with: `testparm -s`.

